<item><title>Peace torch visit shuts Bubanza market for most of a day</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/peace-torch-visit-shuts-bubanza-market-for-most-of-a-day-f61b82/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/peace-torch-visit-shuts-bubanza-market-for-most-of-a-day-f61b82/</guid><category>Burundi</category><description>Traders reopened at 16 h 30, while schools in the town’s commercial centre closed so pupils and teachers could attend the reception.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:17:22 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" length="31311" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Burundi’s refugee agency orders urban return ahead of surprise camp checks</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-s-refugee-agency-orders-urban-return-ahead-of-2c5828/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-s-refugee-agency-orders-urban-return-ahead-of-2c5828/</guid><category>Burundi</category><description>ONPRA representatives demanded formal identification from hundreds of city-dwelling refugees, threatening loss of status for those absent during verification.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:14:24 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-s-refugee-agency-orders-urban-return-ahead-of-2c5828/share.jpg" length="42484" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-s-refugee-agency-orders-urban-return-ahead-of-2c5828/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
